 to the teen pop and Eurodance movements in the mid-1980s and late 1990s, the rise of boy bands and girl groups, and the reintroduction of the vocoder and similar such innovations.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "Zara Larsson", "streams": 34873, "best_position": 39}, {"artist": "AD\u00c9LA", "streams": 29061, "best_position": 52}, {"artist": "Ariana Grande", "streams": 20263, "best_position": 42}, {"artist": "Justin Bieber", "streams": 17418, "best_position": 49}, {"artist": "Michael Jackson", "streams": 17241, "best_position": 50}, {"artist": "Dua Lipa", "streams": 14136, "best_position": 72}, {"artist": "Katy Perry", "streams": 12892, "best_position": 89}, {"artist": "Taylor Swift", "streams": 12874, "best_position": 91}, {"artist": "Beyonc\u00e9", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Britney Spears", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Calvin Harris", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Chappell Roan", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "electronic": {"genre": "electronic", "country_code": "no", "country_name": "Norway", "summary": "Electronic music refers to music that emphasizes the use of electronic musical instruments or electronic music technology as a central aspect of the sound of the music. Historically, electronic music was considered to be any music created with the use of electronic musical instruments or electronic processing, but in modern times, that distinction has been lost because almost all recorded music today, and the majority of live music performances, depend on extensive use of electronics.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "Zara Larsson", "streams": 34873, "best_position": 39}, {"artist": "Michael Jackson", "streams": 17241, "best_position": 50}, {"artist": "Dua Lipa", "streams": 14136, "best_position": 72}, {"artist": "Arctic Monkeys", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Beach House", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Beyonc\u00e9", "s